/** @defgroup keo_json_security_handler Security Handler example
 *
 * This module offers an example implementation of the SHIP Security Handler interface.
 *
 * This implementation is not suitable for use in production. It is only meant to show
 * one simple way of implementing the methods from the interface @ref keo_ship::ShipSecurityHandler.
 *
 * The used trust store writes all trust entries in a human-readable JSON file.
 
 * @see keo_ship::ShipSecurityHandler
 *
